{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle Lads is a roguelike action-strategy game about chaotic tribal warfare.  <br>Fight alongside your troops while barking commands as the chief of your tribe. Each run, draft new champions, experiment with artifacts and upgrades, and conquer shifting maps that play differently every time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/extras/b7e968bb0464897b58e0328417640977.webp?t=1764530656\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/extras/de3b729ffb3b5ac4d27a649c218427ac.poster.avif?t=1764530656\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/extras/de3b729ffb3b5ac4d27a649c218427ac.webm?t=1764530656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/extras/de3b729ffb3b5ac4d27a649c218427ac.mp4?t=1764530656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each tribe comes packed with their own <strong>abilities, units, and upgrades</strong>. Their distinct playstyles shape not just how they <strong>fight</strong>, but how they <strong>conquer</strong> on the strategic map.  Take the <strong>Mad Tribe</strong>, who recklessly dive into battle sending hordes of expendable peons while ramshackle war wagons thunder across the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/extras/6b617751e0ae6d70f7561b0390e495cb.webp?t=1764530656\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/extras/1d5d4b4513294212dafff736652d0cfc.poster.avif?t=1764530656\" width=1170 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/extras/1d5d4b4513294212dafff736652d0cfc.webm?t=1764530656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/extras/1d5d4b4513294212dafff736652d0cfc.mp4?t=1764530656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To <strong>capture outposts</strong> and <strong>conquer the map</strong>, you'll have to <strong>earn every inch</strong>. Hack and slash through enemies with devastating <strong>abilities</strong> while commanding your lads in <strong>real-time battles</strong>. Build your chief to be a <strong>one-man wrecking crew</strong>, diving headfirst into the chaos. Or become a<strong> master strategist</strong>, barking orders while your warband does the dirty work.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What kind of leader will you be?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/extras/76eb109ad85473095b5a35abc15b8ffe.webp?t=1764530656\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/extras/ef327c2caa3edd0dd6f43b2331d750b4.poster.avif?t=1764530656\" width=1170 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/extras/ef327c2caa3edd0dd6f43b2331d750b4.webm?t=1764530656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/extras/ef327c2caa3edd0dd6f43b2331d750b4.mp4?t=1764530656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit from mighty <strong>champions</strong> and <strong>squads of peons</strong> to fill up your war wagon. Each comes with their own <strong>moveset</strong> and <strong>random traits</strong>. A <strong>Frenzied Bonecrusher</strong> grows permanently stronger with every kill, pair it with a <strong>Medic</strong> to keep its rampage alive. As your troops <strong>fight and level up</strong>, they'll earn powerful <strong>brands</strong>\u00a0that reshape their abilities. Combine units with <strong>game-changing artifacts</strong>\u00a0and your own <strong>skill upgrades</strong>\u00a0to forge an army that's entirely your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/extras/55648e07c0b53a6521bf4e7ea1973995.webp?t=1764530656\" width=616 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/extras/0f759418aca38891b251432cb6a1108f.poster.avif?t=1764530656\" width=1170 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/extras/0f759418aca38891b251432cb6a1108f.webm?t=1764530656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/extras/0f759418aca38891b251432cb6a1108f.mp4?t=1764530656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring <strong>glory to your tribe</strong> by seizing islands teeming with enemies, strange artifacts and <strong>game-changing events</strong>. Expand from your <strong>Village</strong>, uncovering\u00a0new tiles to conquer and constructing outposts in their place. Construct <strong>gold mines, garages, barracks </strong>and <strong>trebuchets</strong>, then upgrade them to power your growing war machine. Each day, order your villagers to <strong>train recruits</strong>,<strong> collect taxes</strong>, or<strong> toss a few peons into the sacrificial pit</strong>\u00a0(for... strategic reasons).<strong></strong><br><br><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every campaign plays out differently with <strong>new tribes</strong>, <strong>new maps</strong> and<strong> war-hungry island spirits</strong> eager to see you fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Fight and Command at Once</strong> \u2013 Hack and slash enemies with powerful abilities while directing your lads in real-time battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <strong>Conquer the Island</strong> \u2013 Expand territory, capture outposts, and outsmart rival tribes across a procedurally shifting map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd9\u200d\u2642\ufe0f <strong>Recruit Champions</strong> \u2013 Each tribe has unique heroes with special attacks and traits that completely change how battles unfold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd5\ufe0f <strong>Command Your Villagers</strong> \u2013 Collect villagers to issue new orders: heal your lads, invest gold, or toss a few peons into the sacrificial pit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Build and Upgrade</strong> \u2013 Construct gold mines, garages, and trebuchets, then strengthen them to power your growing war machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Tribes with Attitude</strong> \u2013 Beasts, Ronin, Mad, Knights, Slashers, and Synths \u2014 each with their own abilities, units, and distinctive style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd01 <strong>Highly Replayable</strong> \u2013 Short campaigns packed with unpredictable encounters, escalating wars, and upgrades that turn your ragtag army into an unstoppable band of maniacs.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3377150?t=1764530656","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/c51f2750c1488c1946588f53037e2900567b5b85/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764530656","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/20cb05ef818b5755598c2f9eef6366b4e0c1bc7d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764530656","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/20cb05ef818b5755598c2f9eef6366b4e0c1bc7d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764530656","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle Lads is a roguelike action-strategy game about chaotic tribal warfare.  <br>Fight alongside your troops while barking commands as the chief of your tribe. Each run, draft new champions, experiment with artifacts and upgrades, and conquer shifting maps that play differently every time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/extras/b7e968bb0464897b58e0328417640977.webp?t=1764530656\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/extras/de3b729ffb3b5ac4d27a649c218427ac.poster.avif?t=1764530656\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/extras/