one-man wrecking crew</strong>, diving headfirst into the chaos. Or become a<strong> master strategist</strong>, barking orders while your warband does the dirty work.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What kind of leader will you be?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/extras/76eb109ad85473095b5a35abc15b8ffe.webp?t=1764530656\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/extras/ef327c2caa3edd0dd6f43b2331d750b4.poster.avif?t=1764530656\" width=1170 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/extras/ef327c2caa3edd0dd6f43b2331d750b4.webm?t=1764530656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/extras/ef327c2caa3edd0dd6f43b2331d750b4.mp4?t=1764530656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit from mighty <strong>champions</strong> and <strong>squads of peons</strong> to fill up your war wagon. Each comes with their own <strong>moveset</strong> and <strong>random traits</strong>. A <strong>Frenzied Bonecrusher</strong> grows permanently stronger with every kill, pair it with a <strong>Medic</strong> to keep its rampage alive. As your troops <strong>fight and level up</strong>, they'll earn powerful <strong>brands</strong>\u00a0that reshape their abilities. Combine units with <strong>game-changing artifacts</strong>\u00a0and your own <strong>skill upgrades</strong>\u00a0to forge an army that's entirely your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/extras/55648e07c0b53a6521bf4e7ea1973995.webp?t=1764530656\" width=616 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/extras/0f759418aca38891b251432cb6a1108f.poster.avif?t=1764530656\" width=1170 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/extras/0f759418aca38891b251432cb6a1108f.webm?t=1764530656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/extras/0f759418aca38891b251432cb6a1108f.mp4?t=1764530656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring <strong>glory to your tribe</strong> by seizing islands teeming with enemies, strange artifacts and <strong>game-changing events</strong>. Expand from your <strong>Village</strong>, uncovering\u00a0new tiles to conquer and constructing outposts in their place. Construct <strong>gold mines, garages, barracks </strong>and <strong>trebuchets</strong>, then upgrade them to power your growing war machine. Each day, order your villagers to <strong>train recruits</strong>,<strong> collect taxes</strong>, or<strong> toss a few peons into the sacrificial pit</strong>\u00a0(for... strategic reasons).<strong></strong><br><br><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every campaign plays out differently with <strong>new tribes</strong>, <strong>new maps</strong> and<strong> war-hungry island spirits</strong> eager to see you fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Fight and Command at Once</strong> \u2013 Hack and slash enemies with powerful abilities while directing your lads in real-time battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <strong>Conquer the Island</strong> \u2013 Expand territory, capture outposts, and outsmart rival tribes across a procedurally shifting map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd9\u200d\u2642\ufe0f <strong>Recruit Champions</strong> \u2013 Each tribe has unique heroes with special attacks and traits that completely change how battles unfold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd5\ufe0f <strong>Command Your Villagers</strong> \u2013 Collect villagers to issue new orders: heal your lads, invest gold, or toss a few peons into the sacrificial pit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Build and Upgrade</strong> \u2013 Construct gold mines, garages, and trebuchets, then strengthen them to power your growing war machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Tribes with Attitude</strong> \u2013 Beasts, Ronin, Mad, Knights, Slashers, and Synths \u2014 each with their own abilities, units, and distinctive style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd01 <strong>Highly Replayable</strong> \u2013 Short campaigns packed with unpredictable encounters, escalating wars, and upgrades that turn your ragtag army into an unstoppable band of maniacs.</p>","developers":["Burning Bagel Games LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/7771c2a1fe7f011037fdf3c5fee9705e13e9869a/header.jpg?t=1764530656","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 12 (Monterey) or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated Apple GPU or Radeon Pro 560X<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><str